#: 73316319af83475baa529023eeecb1d7
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:153
#: 89cfc477df4640e49c2244afb33fa35f
msgid "Initial firmware load can be done with DFU by plugging in USB with the bootloader button pressed. Then you should load the \"with_bl.hex\" firmware, using your favourite DFU loading tool."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-tbs-lucidh7.rst:157
#: 1f7742a903c042da9c5a1bbb283638c2
msgid "Once the initial firmware is loaded you can update the firmware using any ArduPilot ground station software. Updates should be done with the \\*.apj firmware files."
msgstr ""
